  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mongolia COVID-19 Crisis Response (MCCR)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Overall objective: To mitigate the immediate impact of the COVID-19 crisis in Mongolia and support national health systems in the medium and long-term. Specific objective 1: To strengthen capacity of national health systems to monitor, prevent, and control the spread and effects of COVID-19. Specific objective 2: To improve quality of laboratories service delivery; Specific objective 3: To improve accessibility and quality of essential health care logistics and services. &lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
